    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770ac80ed77c7f16f2b8a1e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就是每位选手对胜利的执着──\n她们都有让自己用力踏出最后一步的动机。\n她决心要超越她们，获得第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e96d2c0d46da8499eb777b59e75f1bcf66e83b2de34908f9d4f56faf01db3c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037432.json",
      "json_path": [
