    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c8c86388e77bd963351ff1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时有记者决定要为荣进闪耀制作采访特辑。\n当她看到暂订标题中的“闪光”二字后，\n露出自信的笑容，并说自己会闪耀到最后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13906ac75488694588d8f502e1cc75fcd038d9b17ada3d9beeb03e64d25325ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037432.json",
      "json_path": [
