    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8d6c662c83da78aca586843",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“最后”──这让训练员有预感行程\n即将划下句号，却仍鼓励她要加油\n挑战最大目标“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fec5c4ca6688adef92f368c1590ec27f62928edc32fbe0080d6fcc063c062b65",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
